      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BIONIC HOPE (3) flew the lids and led throughout to get off the mark with her maiden win, then finished a 6 length second last start at this track over 390m (22.09). Good run latest and can go on with it. BUILD IT BOB (2) turned in a plain effort last time when seventh at Wanganui over 520m behind La Vida Loca (31.56) in a Class 1. Has ability and is one of the better chances. CANYA LET LOOSE (6) is building an impressive record and ran one of the quickest times of the card latest with an impressive 6 lengths win (21.65) at this track. Superior out of the boxes and will be in the firing line early. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Has definite claims. PARTY PANTS (1) should be thereabouts.",
